      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The Ld. Trial Court vide impugned judgment dated 12.05.2017 had convicted the appellant for the offence punishable under Section 16(1)(a) read with Section 7 of Prevention of Food Adulteration (hereinafter referred as PFA) Act and vide orde"
    },
    {
