    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e6a73ceebea64ab9935a0a4e7ab374cc_9",
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "labels": [
        "RLC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_labels:RLC"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The appellant No. 2 has been sentenced to pay fine of Rs. 1,00,000/- for the offence punishable u/s 16(1)(a) read with Section 7 of PFA."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d4416fe3f0934698842c717792e90b88_36",
      "summary_section": "issue",
      "labels": [
        "ISSUE"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:issue"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nb. That the Ld. Trial Court has passed the judgment against the facts and without appreciating the contradictory evidence available on the judicial record."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d252ad1aa2ce48909d24b31b22c84109_38",
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "labels": [
        "RLC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_labels:RLC"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "That the trial court did not consider that complainant Sanjeev Kumar Gupta / PW-2 was not present at the premises of appellant No. 1 at the time of alleged raid on 13.09.2005."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ee09e00a75dc40da9341a582e09c503a_41",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": ". No reliance can be placed on the testimony of PW-2."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5240420992444d509e89ab61f4372440_44",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "That the Food Inspector has not tried to associate the independent witness intentionally at the time of sampling."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0861f182688c4eb9965343172924c9be_45",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\ne. That the sample commodity lifted in this case was of vanaspati but under the threat of police, it was mentioned as 'Ghee'."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "fdb07ad7d24e40e9a379e5061b6b0bf2_46",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "f. That the sanctioning authority has given the sanction to file the present case against the appellant without application of his mind and without going through the facts of the case."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e1abdb79c1154bb1924d758d6aef8996_47",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\ng. That the documents alleged to be prepared at the spot were not prepared at the spot but prepared later on in the office and the thumb impression of the accused were taken on blank papers."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5d086131c30043f3ae0f147267da1cfa_48",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
