      "matched_phrases": [
        {
          "pattern": "\\bset\\s+aside\\b",
          "matched_text": "set aside",
          "start": 154,
          "end": 163
        }
      ],
      "text_preview": "\nIt is prayed that in view of grounds of appeal, the impugned judgment dated 12.05.2017 and order on the point of sentence dated 18.05.2017 may kindly be set aside."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "90a23803a8214d65a3e3ad765515713d_52",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In the present appeal, amongst the other grounds, the main ground taken by the appellants is that the sample which was taken was not of the 'ghee' but of 'vanaspati'."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "de22c36c0f9e4a51bd8cdac39ff9f42b_53",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Admittedly, the appellants have not led any evidence before the Ld. ACMM on this aspect."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d310ee5e0f9a4a438e0e6b5377f933ae_54",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Further, during the cross-examination of PW-1 and PW-2"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "534a0fbfb8854b0697e53158966d63d8_55",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": ", there is not even a single suggestion that the sample which was taken was not of the 'ghee' but of 'vanaspati'."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "dc09c847a9a14f2db651c6f171ea192e_56",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The said plea has been taken by the appellant No. 1 for the first time during SA u/s 313 Cr.P.C."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a6fb5faea5fb45b7ac0b074be2553446_57",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The Ld. ACMM in the impugned judgment has dealt with the said argument of the Ld. Counsel for appellants regarding the identity of the sample taken."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c99b3c87cb6a451685b50c053f55969d_58",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "He while dealing on this issue, has rightly noted that:\n\"the accused persons have never questioned the identity of the food article during trial."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6a62b6a58e81425ba8ff50024620dd00_59",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "That when the prosecution witnesses were examined, they categorically deposed that they lifted the Digitally signed by Kiran Kiran Gupta Date:\n Gupta 2024.06.03  15:23:22  +0530 sample of ghee."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8c3f3fbfcc2c4b558775dac545f7000c_60",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The defence never questioned them as to the identity of the article."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "37025651b43246e5862119bb9884abb5_61",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nNot even a single suggestion was given to them to the effect that the food article was not ghee or some other article other than ghee or was vanaspati, so as to enable them to accept, rebut or give an explanation to the same."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "115f5aa07a614bcfa6716f66901d9358_62",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As per record, it is evident that at the time of sampling, FI had prepared several documents."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "029bba19070149788b3f1e6c06d98bf8_63",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "All these documents bear the signature of appellant No. 1 / vendor and there is no endorsement of protest mentioned on these documents claiming that the food article was not ghee."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6064341d0a9b49d0b989e71c4570e979_64",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "There is Mahinder Kumar Khandelwal And Oth vs State on 3 June, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/41663703/\n6 nothing on record to show that the appellants have subsequently sent the representation to PFA department in this re"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "16d9690b959b44e685ab270d9c042da8_65",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Neither any representation nor any complaint was filed by the appellants before PFA department or any other forum."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2f33558020454651b3baa784f2bd0c2f_66",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nFurther, the submission of Ld. Counsel for appellant is contrary to the questions put during cross-examination of PW-1 and PW-2."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f3556fc20b5148599ac3706d4c196473_67",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "During cross-examination of PW-1, in fact it is suggested that accused did not prepare \"nakli ghee\" but \"asli ghee\".\""
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "48490e3f315242858ef34c659925cdb0_68",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "9. It seems that the appellants have taken the plea disputing the nature of the article for the first time at the time of Digitally signed by Kiran Kiran Gupta Date:\n Gupta 2024.06.03  15:23:28  +0530 SA recorded u/s 313 Cr.P.C and at the t"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4247acf558564f9885ce0f0974d6bd7b_69",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The Ld. ACMM in the impugned judgment has discussed this aspect in detail and there is no infirmity in finding that the sample which was seized was ghee and not vanaspati as claimed."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ff85952e08114243904a958c7cd376d2_70",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Further, the documents Ex.PW1/A to Ex.PW1/C were prepared by FI on the spot and bears the signature of appellant no. 1, hence, the argument of Ld.\nCounsel for appellants that FI / PW2 was not present on the spot and that the documents were "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "212d6dc20628458dbc3a5b0c1edd9501_71",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "10. Now, coming to the other ground of the appellants that the Ld. Trial Court has failed to appreciate that the witnesses deposed before the court were against the facts and contradictory to each other."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "296334f252ce4dd8940d3ac24fc38669_72",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Though the appellants have taken the said ground, however, they have nowhere described as to how and in which manner the deposition of witnesses were against the facts or contrary to each other."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d252b42752aa4c87931b68f1486549e7_73",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "No contradiction in the deposition of witnesses which is fatal to the case of prosecution, is pointed out by the appellants."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "420fec354a1740fba67b1079ff139004_74",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Further, the non joining of the public witnesses Digitally signed by Kiran Kiran Gupta Date:\n Gupta 2024.06.03  15:23:34  +0530 Mahinder Kumar Khandelwal And Oth vs State on 3 June, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/41663703/"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "92bc3af7011e4daa97a7560fc90c379a_75",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "11. One of the grounds / argument of the Ld."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1b057551c3894a83999fead396138d73_76",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Counsel for the appellants is that the sanctioning authority has given the sanction without application of mind."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a592c9bdc0234e42bdb140ca274e96eb_77",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In the present matter the sanction was taken by Food Inspector PW-2 Sh. Sanjeev Kumar Gupta from the then Director, PFA and thereafter a complaint Ex.PW2/D was filed in the court."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "59043123ef274bb88e8ecd612f75f3f0_78",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The appellant has failed to disclose any material on record which reflects that the sanction to prosecute was given by Director, PFA without application of mind."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1394ea340ca246ac9fe4a2c19cce2d1b_79",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In the absence of any material to support this contention, the same is not tenable."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "439c36ef6f03444586e08e6231abbb31_80",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "12. Now, coming to the other ground / contention that the Ld. Trial Court has wrongly placed reliance on the PA report."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f06070c30b5b4b20a87f8a075d5baab8_81",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
