      "annotation_id": "7c5120988e8948dfb4fa869676db94b1_83",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In the present case, the appellants did not exercise such rights."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4a6fb3a493494472a1a3cee84d4b3352_84",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Their Digitally signed by Kiran Kiran Gupta Date:\n Gupta 2024.06.03  15:23:39  +0530 application filed before the Ld. ACMM was dismissed on 11.06.2008."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6ab9c3c49c6a410c9ff69a2aa72e2ca7_85",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The said order was never challenged by the appellants, hence it attained finality."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "eac5446d435347baba7eee7c19fc2deb_86",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "On the contrary, PW-2 proved Ex.PW2/C1 which contains the acknowledgment by appellant No. 1 of receipt of intimation letters."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "318338366ab94ded8597d1ed54b19837_87",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As per the report, BR reading was found by the PA to be 52.5 (which should be within the range of 40.0 to 43.0) as per standards."
    },
