      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Accordingly, the appeal against the judgment dated 12.05.2017 is dismissed."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e7bf3c98581b416193e80a02c297e4b0_95",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The appellants in the present appeal have also challenged the order on the point of sentence dated 18.05.2017."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "17704c7400e74300ae393b7fab4c057a_96",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is argued that the PFA Act has been recently amended which prescribes the punishment of fine also."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "09d6f10b176c442fac5ac02fcab23939_97",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is prayed that in view of pendency of case for a long period, a lenient view may kindly be taken."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2e0a27f38a57468093d25f3d5a5957dd_98",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "On the other hand it is argued on behalf of department by Ld. Chief Public Prosecutor that the Ld. Trial Court has already taken a lenient view and there is no illegality in the order of sentence."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0284aaf498ca4c2ab90cc78edfa0256f_99",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "15. The appellant/convict is convicted for commission of offence punishable under Section 16(1)(a)\nof PFA Act wherein the minimum sentence of imprisonment was awarded."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1faf189a12be453baa954390d798aba3_100",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "However, w.e.f.\n15.10.2007, new Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 came into force in which, for similar offence,\nthe punishment of only of fine has been prescribed."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "66d2e84fb2664453a951aa39edfc6501_103",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In view of above, question for consideration before this court is whether after repeal of earlier Act and introduction of new Act which contains the lesser punishment, the court can take a lenient view of awarding the lesser punishment."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c21479e2c39848a6b3a2ab781a9790bb_104",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "On this issue, Hon'ble Supreme Court in case titled as M/s A. K. Sarkar & Company & Anr. Vs. The State of West Bengal & Ors, Special Leave Petition(Criminal) No.6095 of 2018, dated 07.03.2024, has observed that:\n\"Whether the appellant can b"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e646812d6f18478da679a9f18ed76676_105",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "This court in T. Barai VS. Henry Ah Hoe (1983) 1 SCC 177, had held that when an amendment is beneficial to the accused it can be applied even to cases pending the courts where such a provision did not exist at the time of commission of offe"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4834eab66c4a425ca84cbb40b1c1827d_106",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "17. The recent judgment of Hon'ble Supreme Court in case M/s A. K. Sarkar & Company &\nAnr.(supra) has made it Digitally signed by Kiran Kiran Gupta Date:\n Gupta 2024.06.03  15:23:57  +0530 clear that if there is an amendment in the Act, whi"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0f1026a6518f4d6391d0c83c8257109c_107",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The ratio of judgment M/s A. K. Sarkar & Company & Anr.(supra) is squarely applicable to the facts of present case."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0d2ec27cc6824b90b235178257f4a828_108",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore on the basis of above case law, I have no hesitation to hold that this court can take a lenient view as per new provisions of law."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0b882d819a164a708333a257958b00b7_109",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "18. In the present case the complaint was filed on 15.05.2006."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "fef8bf9d875d48458c61d246fc26cf00_110",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The appellants were held guilty and convicted for the offences punishable under Section 7/16(1)(a) of PFA Act for selling adulterated food in violation of Section 2(ia)(a) and (m) of PFA Act and have been sentenced as follows:\na."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9727a463419f47f0b2c0814daa727c47_111",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The appellant no. 1 has been sentenced to undergo SI for one year with fine of Rs.\n50,000/- for the offence punishable under Section 16(1)(a) read with Section 7 of PFA Act and to undergo simple imprisonment for one month in default of paym"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "67b633e399b449b1a159b9395f1d76ca_112",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Digitally  signed by"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "034c02bab09d40bca9c152ff7a9df361_115",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The appellant No. 2 has been sentenced to pay fine of Rs. 1,00,000/- for offence punishable u/s 16(1)(a) read with Section 7 of PFA.\n19."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "52256f90bb3b4480bbcaec3412b98351_117",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The circumstances disclosed by Ld. Counsel for the appellants/convicts also warrants taking of a lenient view."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f35ad9b7011e48eea6ccc9c2e73f34f4_118",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Considering all the aspects; nature of offence as alleged,\nsubmissions made, a lenient view is taken and the sentence imposed by the Ld. Trial court vide order dated 18.05.2017 for commission of offence under Section 16(1)(a) of PFA Act is "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "fff5cd0386f942798329d33264ec1d2a_119",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The appellant no"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4112f2dabbbc472495a21b7592f0eecf_120",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": ". 1 is sentenced to pay fine of Rs. 1,25,000/-."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "7b3a731071124241a240d52000d42dac_121",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The order on sentence with respect to appellant no. 2 is upheld."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b42ab7a4a7f74d62b86c7dd812a2afc0_122",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
